# --- node-llama-cpp. Ships for real as node_modules content (NOT bundled
# into extension.js — its compiled JS uses top-level await, which esbuild
# can't put into a CJS bundle; see build-extension.js's header comment).
# That means every pure-JS package in node-llama-cpp's runtime dependency
# closure needs to be un-ignored here too, not just node-llama-cpp itself —
# see the GENERATED block below for those (91 packages as of 2026-08-25,
# far too many to hand-maintain reliably).
!node_modules/node-llama-cpp
!node_modules/node-llama-cpp/**

